WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:01.960
See the guest out!

00:03.280 --> 00:04.680
Fine!

00:05.200 --> 00:06.920
I shall see for myself—

00:07.160 --> 00:08.200
In a few days' time,

00:08.280 --> 00:10.613
Whether you can still afford to be this stubborn!

00:22.200 --> 00:24.533
This man will become a grave peril in the future.

00:25.200 --> 00:26.600
We cannot allow him to return alive.

00:27.440 --> 00:28.840
Understood.

00:34.000 --> 00:39.000
Zhu Yuanzhi dispatched a squad of trusted men to secretly intercept Shi Lang. Though they wounded him severely, they ultimately failed to capture him.

00:39.500 --> 00:43.500
The threat of the pursuing enemy forces still remained unresolved.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.000
Although Zhu Yuanzhi led a detachment to cover the rear and stall the enemy, their numbers were simply too few...

00:48.200 --> 00:52.500
A few days later, the main force of the Qingzhou Army caught up with you after all, and you were forced to engage them.

00:52.600 --> 00:55.480
After days of bitter, unrelenting fighting, still unable to secure victory,

00:55.760 --> 00:58.760
The army's morale collapsed completely.

00:58.840 --> 01:00.080
Terrified of future execution and purges by the imperial court,

01:00.240 --> 01:03.120
The soldiers defected one after another, and you tragically perished amidst the chaotic rout.
